+
+    // @Param: PUSH_PIT
+    // @DisplayName: Pusher pitch feed-forward gain
+    // @Description: Normalised pitch moment added to the main rotors per (pusher_norm^2). Positive commands nose-UP. Tune so steady-state pitch error stays ~0 as pusher rises. This is the term that prevents the nose-down runaway.
+    // @Range: -0.5 0.5
